# Elliptic++ benchmark (scripts/run_elliptic_benchmark.py): unlike the
# other data/raw/ sources, txs_features.csv alone is ~694MB -- far past
# GitHub's non-LFS size limit and not "small" -- so this one stays
# ignored. Re-fetch via:
#   curl -o data/raw/elliptic_pp/txs_features.csv \
#     https://media.githubusercontent.com/media/git-disl/EllipticPlusPlus/main/Transactions%20Dataset/txs_features.csv
#   (same URL pattern for txs_classes.csv, txs_edgelist.csv)
data/raw/elliptic_pp/
